			"audioEventDensity": 0, // [Blind Test] Total speech, music, or SFX events occurring per minute from 0 to 5 (0 = No Sound, 1 = Extremely sparse, 5 = Hyper-dense social-native layout/information overload). MUST strictly follow this predefined range or options. Do not append any out-of-range words, explanations, or numbers.
