			"dynamicRange": 0, // [Blind Test] Amplitude variance between the quietest floor and loudest peak from  0 to 5 (0 = No sound, 1 = Strongly brickwalled/highly compressed broadcast sound, 5 = Cinematic style high dynamic range). MUST strictly follow this predefined range or options. Do not append any out-of-range words, explanations, or numbers.
